<p>anatine: of or pertaining to, resembling or characteristic of, a duck<br />
cancrine: having the qualities of a crab<br />
caprine: of or relating to a goat<br />
columbine: of, belonging to, or of the nature of, a dove or pigeon<br />
formicine: of, or of the nature of, ants<br />
fringilline: pertaining to the finches<br />
hippotigrine:  of or relating to a zebra<br />
leporine: relating to a hare<br />
lutrine: relating to the otter family<br />
musteline: of or like a weasel<br />
pavonine: of, relating to, resembling, or characteristic of a peacock<br />
procyonine: of raccoons<br />
sciurine: of or relating to squirrels<br />
suilline: of or relating to pigs<br />
talpine: relating to the moles<br />
viverrine: resembling or related to the civet<br />
